        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "text": "On November 3, 2025, <PERSON> and its east wing collapsed on Cobbett Row, prompting an immediate warning for the street and requests for assistance on Imber Street.",
