              "tweet_ids": [
                8,
                9,
                10,
                11,
                16
              ],
              "id": "2a.1"
            },
            {
              "text": "Later on November 3, Provincial Urban Search and Rescue deployed to the site, injuries were documented across Nerridge, and the Nerridge Fire Service rescued nine people.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                28,
                41,
                53
              ],
              "id": "2a.2"
            },
            {
              "text": "On November 4, search and rescue personnel from PUSAR continued extraction operations, rescuing additional individuals from the rubble.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                112,
                113,
                117
              ],
              "id": "2a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "On November 6, official information was released regarding the collapsed east wing as rescue operations concluded.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                151,
                152,
                153
              ],
              "id": "2a.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "On November 8, fatalities were officially confirmed from the collapse, Nerridge Police deployed to manage the area, approximately 85 individuals were displaced, and the Provincial Building Safety Board convened.",
